exports[`what a shopper reads, state by state > linkUsed 1`] = `
"Product check
# This check has expired
Each tap makes a one-time link, and this one was already used.
## Tap the tag again
Hold the top of your phone on the tag to get a fresh check.
## Why links expire
A copied link, a screenshot or a forwarded message can't pass as a real check.
Only a new tap on the real tag counts. It takes a second.
## How the check works
- Every tag proves itself
Each tap makes a one-time code that only the real tag can produce. A copy fails.
- Brands register each item
The check compares the tag with the brand's record of that exact item.
- Records can't be quietly changed
They are kept on a public ledger that anyone can inspect.
## Need help?
[Report a problem → mailto:info@tagit.network?subject=Help%20with%20a%20product%20check]
Pilot version. Records are kept on a public test network, and the system has not completed an external security audit.
[TAG IT Network → https://www.tagit.network]"
`;

